@startuml
title UC-ED-002 派发采编同步任务 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "办公部部长" as A
boundary "接口:部长接口" as B
control "控制:派发采编同步任务控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "E:采编协同" as E
participant "O:成员" as O
A -> B: 派发采编同步任务(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 派发采编同步任务(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> E: 派发同步(部长、承接成员、可选期限)
activate E
E -> O: 验证归属(办公部)
O --> E: 成员资格
E --> C: 唯一承接结果或状态不允许原因
deactivate E

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
